.venv/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
*.egg-info/
*.sqlite
*.sqlite-wal
*.sqlite-shm

# NOTE: `.coord/` is deliberately NOT listed here. It is local coordination
# state, excluded via .git/info/exclude, which applies to THIS CHECKOUT ONLY and
# is not distributed with the repository.
#
# What that achieves: the coordination files' CONTENTS stay out of normal status
# and staging. What it does NOT achieve: it is not secrecy about the arrangement
# (this comment names it, and so does CLAUDE.md), and it is not a security
# boundary -- neither a local exclude nor a tracked ignore rule prevents
# `git add -f`. Keeping it untracked is a working convention, not an enforcement
# mechanism.
